  "st9_chap": "Belief",
  "st1_nar": "· [[Rutuja Publication]] ·|· ऋतुजा पब्लिकेशन ·//**Where learning begins,|and confidence grows.",
  "st1_imp": "Right start|Practice|Confidence",
  "st2_nar": "[[Rajmata Jijau]] shaped Shivba,|and [[Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj]]|laid the foundation of Swarajya.//[[Savitribai]] and [[Mahatma Phule]]|laid the first brick of education —",
  "st2_imp": "Beginning|with|girls",
  "st3_nar": "[[Rajarshi Shahu Maharaj]]|opened those doors [[to everyone]].//[[Dr Babasaheb Ambedkar]] gave|education, equality and justice —",
  "st3_imp": "The|Constitution's|foundation",
  "st4_nar": "In every age [[Maharashtra]]|has given India direction.//That direction was not given|by the [[sword]] alone —",
  "st4_imp": "Direction|given by|the idea",
  "st5_nar": "These ideas took shape in|[[Maharashtra's soil]], grew, took root —//and became part of|[[the nation's world of thought]].",
  "st5_imp": "Swarajya|Equality|Education",
  "st6_nar": "[[Maharashtra]] is not merely|a state of India —//it is a foundation of India's|[[journey of thought]].//And that foundation is [[not of stone]].//**On the foundation of a Maharashtra of ideas.",
  "st6_imp": "A foundation|of|people",
  "st7_nar": "Where a child forms|the first [[letter]].//Where the first [[word]] is read.|Where the first [[number]] is understood.//Where the first [[question]]|rises in the mind —",
  "st7_imp": "Why?|and|How?",
  "st8_nar": "From the first [[letter]].|From the first [[number]].|From the first [[confidence]].//**Rutuja Publication works exactly there.//The foundation expected of children|at the [[primary stage]] —",
  "st8_imp": "Making|the foundation|firm",
  "st9_nar": "“Every child has the [[capacity to learn]];|what is needed is [[the right beginning]].”//>>Reading → Writing → Language → Maths|>>Understanding → Practice → Confidence",
  "st9_imp": "The right|beginning",
  "st1_tag": "शिकण्याची सुरुवात,\nआत्मविश्वासाची वाटचाल.",
  "st1_tag_en": "Where learning begins and confidence grows"
